*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "QL1100AF.PPD"
*Product: "(Brother QL-1100 Label Print Server)"
*Manufacturer: "Brother"
*ModelName: "Brother QL-1100 AutoFit"
*ShortNickName: "Brother QL-1100"
*NickName: "Brother QL-1100 AutoFit Label Printer"
*PSVersion: "(3010) 0"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42

*% Route PDF, JPEG, PNG through our auto-fit filter.
*% Output is vnd.cups-raw because the filter prints directly via brother_ql;
*% the USB backend receives empty data.
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/vnd.cups-raw 0 brother-ql-autofit"
*cupsFilter2: "image/jpeg application/vnd.cups-raw 0 brother-ql-autofit"
*cupsFilter2: "image/png application/vnd.cups-raw 0 brother-ql-autofit"

*% ── Media Sizes ────────────────────────────────────────────────
*% Dimensions in PostScript points (1pt = 1/72 inch, 1mm ≈ 2.835pt)

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w176h842
*PageSize w176h842/62mm Endless: "<</PageSize[176 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w176h283/62x100mm Die-Cut: "<</PageSize[176 283]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w153h842/54mm Endless: "<</PageSize[153 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w142h842/50mm Endless: "<</PageSize[142 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w108h842/38mm Endless: "<</PageSize[108 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w82h842/29mm Endless: "<</PageSize[82 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: w176h842
*PageRegion w176h842/62mm Endless: "<</PageRegion[176 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w176h283/62x100mm Die-Cut: "<</PageRegion[176 283]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w153h842/54mm Endless: "<</PageRegion[153 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w142h842/50mm Endless: "<</PageRegion[142 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w108h842/38mm Endless: "<</PageRegion[108 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w82h842/29mm Endless: "<</PageRegion[82 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageRegion[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: w176h842
*ImageableArea w176h842/62mm Endless: "0 0 176 842"
*ImageableArea w176h283/62x100mm Die-Cut: "0 0 176 283"
*ImageableArea w153h842/54mm Endless: "0 0 153 842"
*ImageableArea w142h842/50mm Endless: "0 0 142 842"
*ImageableArea w108h842/38mm Endless: "0 0 108 842"
*ImageableArea w82h842/29mm Endless: "0 0 82 842"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "0 0 612 792"

*DefaultPaperDimension: w176h842
*PaperDimension w176h842/62mm Endless: "176 842"
*PaperDimension w176h283/62x100mm Die-Cut: "176 283"
*PaperDimension w153h842/54mm Endless: "153 842"
*PaperDimension w142h842/50mm Endless: "142 842"
*PaperDimension w108h842/38mm Endless: "108 842"
*PaperDimension w82h842/29mm Endless: "82 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"

*% ── Resolution ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% ── Color Model ────────────────────────────────────────────────
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% -- Printer settings ------------------------------------------------
*% Generated by `brother-label-settings --model QL-1100 ppd-options`;
*% tests/test_print_server.py fails if this block and the package differ.
*OpenGroup: QLSettings/Stored Printer Settings
*OpenUI *QLAutoPowerOff/Auto power off (AC adapter): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLAutoPowerOff
*DefaultQLAutoPowerOff: NoChange
*QLAutoPowerOff NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLAutoPowerOff Never/Never: ""
*QLAutoPowerOff 1Hour/1 hour: ""
*QLAutoPowerOff 2Hours/2 hours: ""
*QLAutoPowerOff 4Hours/4 hours: ""
*QLAutoPowerOff 8Hours/8 hours: ""
*QLAutoPowerOff 12Hours/12 hours: ""
*CloseUI: *QLAutoPowerOff
*OpenUI *QLAutoPowerOn/Power on when plugged in: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLAutoPowerOn
*DefaultQLAutoPowerOn: NoChange
*QLAutoPowerOn NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLAutoPowerOn Off/Off: ""
*QLAutoPowerOn On/On: ""
*CloseUI: *QLAutoPowerOn
*OpenUI *QLCutMode/Cutter: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLCutMode
*DefaultQLCutMode: NoChange
*QLCutMode NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLCutMode Off/Off: ""
*QLCutMode CutAfterEachLabel/Cut after each label: ""
*QLCutMode CutAtEndOfJob/Cut at end of job: ""
*CloseUI: *QLCutMode
*OpenUI *QLPrintDataAfterPrinting/Print data after printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLPrintDataAfterPrinting
*DefaultQLPrintDataAfterPrinting: NoChange
*QLPrintDataAfterPrinting NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLPrintDataAfterPrinting Erase/Erase: ""
*QLPrintDataAfterPrinting Keep/Keep: ""
*CloseUI: *QLPrintDataAfterPrinting
*OpenUI *QLInfoReport/Information report contents: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLInfoReport
*DefaultQLInfoReport: NoChange
*QLInfoReport NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLInfoReport TransferredData/Transferred data: ""
*QLInfoReport PrinterSettings/Printer settings: ""
*QLInfoReport UsageLog/Usage log: ""
*QLInfoReport All/All: ""
*CloseUI: *QLInfoReport
*OpenUI *QLSerializeMode/Numbering after a job: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLSerializeMode
*DefaultQLSerializeMode: NoChange
*QLSerializeMode NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLSerializeMode ContinueFromLastNumber/Continue from last number: ""
*QLSerializeMode ResetToStartingNumber/Reset to starting number: ""
*CloseUI: *QLSerializeMode
*OpenUI *QLCommandMode/Command mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *QLCommandMode
*DefaultQLCommandMode: NoChange
*QLCommandMode NoChange/Don't change: ""
*QLCommandMode Raster/Raster: ""
*QLCommandMode ESCP/ESC/P: ""
*QLCommandMode PTouchTemplate/P-touch Template: ""
*CloseUI: *QLCommandMode
*CloseGroup: QLSettings
